 r←Test_Misc_023(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;successFlag;msg
⍝ Exercise `PerformConfigChecks`: valid Tatin dependency folders are accepted.
⍝ This is the control for Test_Misc_024 to Test_Misc_026.
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 r←T._Failed

 ⍝ No target namespace: packages go into the project space
 (successFlag msg)←##.Cider.PerformConfigChecks ∆GetConfigForChecks'packages_dev'
 →T.PassesIf 1≡successFlag
 →T.PassesIf 0=≢msg

 ⍝ With a target namespace
 (successFlag msg)←##.Cider.PerformConfigChecks ∆GetConfigForChecks'packages_dev=TestCases'
 →T.PassesIf 1≡successFlag
 →T.PassesIf 0=≢msg

 r←T._OK
⍝Done
